WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.244
Positive curvature makes a space thin.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.077
Squash the manifold onto a skeleton two dimensions lower.

3
00:00:06.227 --> 00:00:09.561
Every piece that lands on one point stays uniformly small.

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.188
Claimed: true in every dimension, even under the spectral condition.

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.777
Manuscript only, no Lean yet.
